  "title": "Zesty Fresh Thai Mung Bean Sprouts Yum Salad",
  "description": "A fresh and tender Thai dish featuring mung bean sprouts, perfect for a lazy Sunday, dairy-free-friendly and served in a corn husk wrap.",
