  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the mung bean sprouts and drain well.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together shio-koji, lime juice, fish sauce, and chili flakes.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts, garlic, and cilantro to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Spoon the salad onto the center of a corn husk.",
    "Fold the sides of the corn husk over the filling and roll up to form a tight cylinder.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ingredients.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
